<title>USA: GN Netcom buys Dynatech's Unex unit.</title>
<headline>GN Netcom buys Dynatech's Unex unit.</headline>
<dateline>EDEN PRAIRIE MINN. 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>GN Netcom, a subsidiary of Danish-based  GN Great Nordic Group, said Tuesday it purchased New Hampshire-based Unex Corp, a headset manufacturer, from Dynatech Corp.</p>
<p>Terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>A new entity, GN Netcom/Unex Inc, was formed by the merger of GN Netcom's North American organization. It manufactures communication headsets.</p>
<p>-- Chicago newsdesk 312 408-8787</p>
</text>
